		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Toward the One, I concur with what others have said about beloved Ahmaddin.<br />
Ahmaddin led a weekly class to study Inayat Khan&#8217;s writings @ the Mentorgarden the Winter of 1991. I was privileged to attend, it was always a highlight of this mureed&#8217;s week.<br />
Ya Salaam !<br />
p.s. My understanding is His ashes are to be interred at SWSC near Pir Moineddin C. Jablonski.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
