		<description><![CDATA[I only caught glimpses of him over the years on my sojourns to California for Mevlevi events... my clearest memory of him is his power and a sense that there was just no nonsense about him. I treasure that.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I only caught glimpses of him over the years on my sojourns to California for Mevlevi events&#8230; my clearest memory of him is his power and a sense that there was just no nonsense about him. I treasure that.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
